7359_1411155443060399617_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-gpR51mE95UQ7kNvwFVhEgo&_nc_oc=AdlZJWqRcPjZFr4jkU2jKSACtd4KKY0KzkvUR1rQ37SMAh7KvidbvRixxCPULkc5OOo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy8xo1fFmNUNurNcW6WQ-t6FFEGYs1j8TW5E-5ZGxs4Pg&oe=69BD5A0B"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "3814418192216575", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223482_3814418195549908_5866507427421967146_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FzeBij-5iXIQ7kNvwG4Gbwe&_nc_oc=AdmhMqi6hESwihosyN5xeQI2RCdPPO89t6SvmO5zil4dd7iDzK1E2md1VEmdduG-3Is&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzMKFyhHPuAH8Rwl8zwnK2_JJygtN1Noyafpc-C7aWiiQ&oe=69BD60F7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Carbon Ville", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to Carbon Ville \u2013 Your Ultimate Virtual Fitness Oasis on Meta Oculus! \n\nImmerse yourself in the future of workouts with our groundbreaking VR app. Join instructor-led spin classes, embark on interactive fitness adventures, and connect with a vibrant global community. Elevate your routine with stunning environments and spatial audio.  All you need is a stationary bike and your headset.\n\nKey Features:\n\nComing Soon : Multiplayer Workouts: Connect with friends and fitness enthusiasts in real time. Available in the paid version for an even more engaging experience.\n\nOn-Demand Classes: Enjoy flexibility with on-demand classes at your fingertips. Take your fitness journey anywhere, anytime.\n\nMassive Video Library: Access a vast library of workout videos for all fitness levels and preferences.\n\nEco-Friendly Rewards: Earn points for every workout, converted into real tree plantings worldwide. Make your fitness routine a positive force for the planet.\n\nWhy Carbon Ville?\nUnleash the power of immersive fitness in Carbon Ville. Upgrade soon to the paid version for multiplayer fun and a comprehensive video library. Your 